    "body": "Just an idea, but what about abstracting this into something like a `common-characters` attribute which could be used at the browsers discretion to provide easy access to additional keys; `<input type=\"text\" common-characters=\"@,#\">` might be useful for social networking sites, while `<input type=\"number\". common-characters=\"+,-,*,/,=\">` would be useful for a calculator.",
