    "created_at": "2019-05-03T13:27:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-05-03T13:27:27Z",
    "body": "For inputmode we chose the intersection between what is supported on popular mobile platforms (Android and iOS). It is not possible to set a \"twitter\" keyboard on Android. There is a [\"short-text\"](https://developer.android.com/reference/android/widget/TextView.html#attr_android:inputType) type and I think we should try to understand how that behaves whether it provides the same functionality as the \"twitter\" keyboard on iOS.",
